FINAL REMINDER
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

SkillVerse is not a course platform.
SkillVerse is not an LMS.
SkillVerse is a Career Workspace — a guided journey system.

Every design decision, every component, every interaction
should communicate: "You are on your way to becoming
a professional. Here is exactly where you are. Here is
exactly what to do next."

The user should never feel lost.
The user should always feel progress.
The user should always feel that their goal is reachable.

Build with that intention.